===Etymology===
From {{der|en|de|Toluin}}, from {{m|de|Tolu}} ({{m|en|Tolú}}) where it was first distilled.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtɒl.juː.iːn/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtɑl.ju.in/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|organic compound}} A [[colourless]], [[inflammable]] [[liquid]] [[hydrocarbon]], [[methyl]][[benzene]], CH<sub>3</sub>.C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>, used as a [[solvent]], in [[high-octane]] [[fuel]]s and in the production of many [[chemical]] [[compound]]s.

